{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "uWallet ALROYA - Production",
		"description": "Production Postman collection for uWallet A2A CliQ Merchant Interface (ALROYA).\n\n## Features\n- Auto-token refresh: token is fetched and reused automatically across requests\n- Auto CorrelationID generation for every request\n- Auto MessageTrxID generation for Purchase requests\n\n## Setup\nAll credentials are stored as collection variables. To rotate them, edit the collection variables (NOT the requests).\n\n## Security\nNEVER commit this file to public repositories. Treat it as a secret.\n\n## Endpoints\n1. **Get Token** - manual token fetch (auto-refresh handles this normally)\n2. **Purchase** - create a payment request\n3. **Payment Inquiry** - check payment status\n4. **Health Check (DNS)** - quick connectivity sanity check",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Get Token (manual)",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"// Skip the collection-level auto-refresh for this request (it IS the token request)",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('skipAutoToken', 'true');",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('correlationId', 'REQ-' + Date.now() + '-' + Math.floor(Math.random()*100000));"
						]
					}
				},
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('skipAutoToken', 'false');",
							"",
							"pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"const data = pm.response.json();",
							"if (data && data.TokenInfo && data.TokenInfo.Token) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.TokenInfo.Token);",
							"    const expiry = new Date(data.TokenInfo.ExpiryDate).getTime();",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenExpiry', expiry.toString());",
							"    console.log('Token saved. Expires at:', data.TokenInfo.ExpiryDate);",
							"} else {",
							"    console.error('Token not found in response:', data);",
							"}"
						]
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					},
					{
						"key": "CorrelationID",
						"value": "{{correlationId}}"
					},
					{
						"key": "MerchantID",
						"value": "{{merchantId}}"
					},
					{
						"key": "UserID",
						"value": "{{userId}}"
					},
					{
						"key": "Password",
						"value": "{{password}}"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"SecurityKey\": \"{{securityKey}}\"\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/A2AMerchantInterface/GetToken",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"A2AMerchantInterface",
						"GetToken"
					]
				},
				"description": "Manually fetch a token. Normally you don't need to run this — the collection-level pre-request script auto-refreshes the token before any other request."
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Purchase",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"// Auto-generate a unique MessageTrxID for this purchase if not set",
							"const today = new Date();",
							"const yyyymmdd = today.getFullYear().toString() + ",
							"    String(today.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0') + ",
							"    String(today.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');",
							"const seq = Date.now().toString().slice(-9);",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set('messageTrxId', 'ALROYA-' + yyyymmdd + '-' + seq);",
							"console.log('Generated MessageTrxID:', pm.collectionVariables.get('messageTrxId'));"
						]
					}
				},
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"const body = pm.response.json();",
							"console.log('Purchase response:', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));",
							"",
							"// Save MSGID for later inquiry",
							"if (body && body.MSGID) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('lastMsgId', body.MSGID);",
							"}"
						]
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"auth": {
					"type": "bearer",
					"bearer": [
						{
							"key": "token",
							"value": "{{token}}",
							"type": "string"
						}
					]
				},
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					},
					{
						"key": "CorrelationID",
						"value": "{{correlationId}}"
					},
					{
						"key": "MerchantID",
						"value": "{{merchantId}}"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"MessageTrxID\": \"{{messageTrxId}}\",\n    \"MerchantID\": \"{{merchantId}}\",\n    \"RAliasType\": \"MOBL\",\n    \"RAliasValue\": \"962XXXXXXXXX\",\n    \"Amount\": 1.000,\n    \"CallBackURL\": \"{{callbackUrl}}\"\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/A2AMerchantInterface/Purchase",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"A2AMerchantInterface",
						"Purchase"
					]
				},
				"description": "Create a purchase request.\n\n**Body fields:**\n- `MessageTrxID`: auto-generated as `ALROYA-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXXXXX`\n- `RAliasType`: `MOBL` (mobile number) or `ALIAS` (CliQ alias)\n- `RAliasValue`: customer wallet number/alias\n- `Amount`: payment amount\n- `CallBackURL`: your endpoint that uWallet will POST status updates to"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Payment Inquiry",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"// Uses the messageTrxId from the last Purchase by default.",
							"// Override by editing the body below."
						]
					}
				},
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"const body = pm.response.json();",
							"console.log('Inquiry response:', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));",
							"",
							"if (body && body.StatusCode !== undefined) {",
							"    const statusMap = {",
							"        '0': 'Success',",
							"        '300': 'Rejected',",
							"        '310': 'Rejected - No response from PSP',",
							"        '350': 'Timeout'",
							"    };",
							"    console.log('Payment status:', statusMap[body.StatusCode] || 'Unknown', '(' + body.StatusCode + ')');",
							"}"
						]
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"auth": {
					"type": "bearer",
					"bearer": [
						{
							"key": "token",
							"value": "{{token}}",
							"type": "string"
						}
					]
				},
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					},
					{
						"key": "CorrelationID",
						"value": "{{correlationId}}"
					},
					{
						"key": "MerchantID",
						"value": "{{merchantId}}"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"MessageTrxID\": \"{{messageTrxId}}\"\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/A2AMerchantInterface/PaymentInquiry",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"A2AMerchantInterface",
						"PaymentInquiry"
					]
				},
				"description": "Inquire about a previous purchase by `MessageTrxID`.\n\n**StatusCode values:**\n- `0`: Success\n- `300`: Rejected\n- `310`: Rejected - No response from PSP\n- `350`: Timeout"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
